   "body": "/claim cloud/fb-quickwins-sonnet\n\nPlan (one PR, red test first):\n- The clipboard question becomes a `confirmationDialog` whose buttons are verbs, defined as data (`Pending.choices`) so a test pins them: « Coller le lien » / « Insérer [url=XXX] » / « Insérer [url]XXX[/url] » / « Insérer » (the answers), « Insérer sans le presse-papiers », and a real « Annuler » (`role: .cancel`) that inserts nothing, so Esc backs out.\n- `ComposerFormattingModel.choose(_:for:)` applies a choice; tests: every question ends with exactly one « Annuler », no Oui/Non title, cancelling leaves the text unchanged, the clipboardless choice inserts the plain tags, the first choice uses the clipboard.\n- Overlap: draft #1223 also edits `ReplyComposerView.swift` (card growth, other region); #1261 does not touch these files.\n- Draft PR with `compile-check`, Opus review, ready line on #893.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
